The Nikon FTZ II Mount Adapter is an enhanced second-generation Z Mount adapter. With a streamlined design, the Nikon FTZII Mount Adapter features a sleeker design to suit its use on pro cameras with a battery grip.The Nikon FTZ II Mount Adapter enables you to use almost any Nikon F-Mount lens on Z-Mount Mirrorless Cameras. This adapter is ideal for when AF-S and AF-P Type D, and Nikon G-Type lenses are to be used. The Nikon FTZ-II Mount Adapter maintains full autofocus as well as auto exposure for use on a mirrorless body.

